1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,160
Cantá, Brazilian Amazon.

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:04,230
Rosa just pulled up her cassava…

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:06,830
after the weakest rains in forty-five years.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,420
Now, one question.

5
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:09,830
What do I plant next?

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,010
She asks.

7
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:14,420
Our assistant reads NASA satellite data for her land.

8
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:15,480
Rain, and soil.

9
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:17,170
She picks what matters.

10
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,140
Better soil?

11
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,440
Cowpea. It leaves the ground stronger.

12
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:23,370
Most tools chase profit, for big farms.

13
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,280
Ours lets small farmers choose…

14
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,740
and says what it doesn't know.

15
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,240
What to plant next.

16
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:29,700
For every small farm.
